{"name":"The Twelve Lamp","slug":"glyph-twelve-lamp","blurb":"On the census street, Orin carries the lamp toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Twelve. Click the lamp and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Twelve Lamp.","seal":"7bca57fb70427842ad9eb2a7c365d4add72a3d824ee4a5f3cad8c70d9e67a553"}
